# Local development databases. The API defaults to sqlite:///./aiprotect.db,
# so running it in-place drops one next to the source -- and a committed
# database is both a merge conflict nobody can resolve and, later, a way to
# publish real customer rows.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
